Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.33,0:01:55.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, Straw Hat Luffy, this is a good way to die.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.17,0:02:00.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Within six minutes,\Nthis yard will be blown up
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.51,0:02:02.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}along with the Square.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.44,0:02:04.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd stay, but I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.88,0:02:07.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just wait right there, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.48,0:02:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then you can celebrate the\Nnew king of the sand country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:14.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.78,0:02:16.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I should be on my way.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.71,0:02:23.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He said it's in the mortuary\Ntemple to the west of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.90,0:02:32.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(1026,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Missed me.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.97,0:02:45.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! That was way too close.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.62,0:02:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard! He took off!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.19,0:02:57.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think he flew off in that direction.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.89,0:03:01.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He won't get away\Nwith this! Damn him!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.90,0:03:14.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is the royal tomb.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.14,0:03:19.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where generations of your kings\Nlay in their eternal rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.19,0:03:22.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, where's the Poneglyph?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.21,0:03:36.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hidden stairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.51,0:03:41.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Poneglyph is kept\Ndown there, deep underground.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.25,0:03:44.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Most people aren't even aware\Nof the Poneglyph's existence.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Many events occur behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.85,0:03:49.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just because a country belongs\Nto the World Government
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.49,0:03:53.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,doesn't necessarily mean that\Nits king knows what's going on.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.32,0:03:55.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be blamed.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like most people, you probably had no idea
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.83,0:03:59.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there was someone\Nleft in the world
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.23,0:04:00.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who can decipher\Nthe ancient writing.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.73,0:04:02.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can actually read Poneglyphs?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.56,0:04:03.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.92,0:04:07.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why Crocodile and I ended\Nup as a team in the first place.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.32,0:04:11.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's also why he can't\Nkill me. I'm no use dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.30,0:04:12.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is it correct
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.50,0:04:15.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that the Poneglyph in this\Ncountry tells where Pluton is?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.77,0:04:18.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that really the case?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.34,0:04:20.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alabasta's royal family has been obligated
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.78,0:04:22.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for generations now to protect it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.91,0:04:25.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That duty is about the only thing we know about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.48,0:04:28.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Protect? Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.66,0:04:36.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This place is quite impressive.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.53,0:04:39.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's located behind\Nthe doors in the back.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.64,0:04:49.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.13,0:04:52.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.74,0:05:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you die!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.88,0:05:02.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.01,0:05:04.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.19,0:05:06.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get inside Crocodile's head, that's what!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.26,0:05:07.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like, if I were him,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.22,0:05:08.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,where would I wanna\Nshoot a cannon from?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.22,0:05:11.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just keep looking!\NWe only have five minutes!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.56,0:05:14.33,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Five minutes to go\Nbefore a million people all die!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.39,0:05:15.82,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We really need to hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.86,0:05:18.33,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time\Nleft to find the cannon!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper, do you think you can\Nfind the guy by using your nose?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That won't work.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.03,0:05:24.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can smell\Nanywhere is gunpowder!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.20,0:05:25.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to do something!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.34,0:05:26.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Try finding the smell of a guy
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.47,0:05:28.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who's about to blow up the\NSquare with a big cannon.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.87,0:05:30.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kinda smell is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How should I know? Just try it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.56,0:05:39.76,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,A cannonball that can\Nblow up that big an area.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.53,0:05:43.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, in that case,\Nit's gotta be really big.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.06,0:05:44.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if it's gonna be\Nshot out of a cannon,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.56,0:05:46.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then surely can't go very far.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.43,0:05:48.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it's gotta be closer\Nto the Square than this!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.86,0:05:51.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way I have time to go around!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.04,0:05:54.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There! A shortcut!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.01,0:05:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything from the sky, Pell?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I searched every\Nrooftop near the Square,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.39,0:06:01.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't see any\Nsign of a cannon.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.43,0:06:04.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then, it might be in a building somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.63,0:06:06.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right. I'll search them all.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.03,0:06:07.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,How many times must you try this
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.91,0:06:22.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,before giving up?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile, it's you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.12,0:06:40.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like Nico\NRobin made short work of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.09,0:06:41.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must say, I never\Nthought the Marines
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,would follow me to this city.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.76,0:06:45.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's your boss?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.16,0:06:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did that smoky idiot run away\Nand leave you all alone?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.67,0:06:51.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Justice is only for the people who take it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.04,0:06:53.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of world we live in, girl.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.51,0:06:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just go back to\Nyour base and talk about justice
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.04,0:06:58.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,until you're actually\Nready to fight for it?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.07,0:07:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.14,0:07:26.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go? Where?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.37,0:07:30.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me right now!\NWhich way did he go?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.91,0:07:48.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Towards the temple. That way.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.71,0:07:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That direction? Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.33,0:08:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What justice is there?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.56,0:08:16.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To hell with\NMarine Headquarters.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.29,0:08:29.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jeez. I can't move very well.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.33,0:08:33.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is strange.\NI ate all that meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.60,0:08:37.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? These\Nwounds are small.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.54,0:08:40.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder... if I\Nshould lie down.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.44,0:08:44.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, did it tell you everything
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.81,0:08:47.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that you wanted to know?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.40,0:08:58.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I see it. Secret stairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just four more minutes.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't there any others around?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.69,0:09:32.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this all that your country is hiding?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.12,0:09:33.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You aren't satisfied?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.79,0:09:37.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have kept every word of the promise I made to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.93,0:09:38.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.91,0:09:44.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just like any\Nother national secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you look,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.30,0:09:49.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you can't find it unless you already know where it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.90,0:09:54.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is the Poneglyph\Nwe were looking for.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.51,0:09:56.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That didn't take much time.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.16,0:09:58.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that you have this odd thing in front of you,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.90,0:10:01.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,were you able to decipher it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.07,0:10:02.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.27,0:10:07.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very good. Now read it aloud.\NWhat does this thing say?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.44,0:10:11.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Kahira conquered Alabasta
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.88,0:10:14.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in Sky Ephemeris Year 239.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.06,0:10:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In year 260, Taymer\Nruled the Bitain Dynasty.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.33,0:10:24.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In year 306, the Taff Cathedral\Nwas completed in Erumalu.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.17,0:10:26.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In year 325, the hero\NMamdin of Oltia..."
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.01,0:10:28.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on. What's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.88,0:10:31.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this really all the information here?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.20,0:10:33.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about this desert's history!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.90,0:10:36.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want to know about the world's\Nmost dangerous military power
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.87,0:10:38.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that's hiding in this country.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.50,0:10:41.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where is the Pluton hidden?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.51,0:10:43.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That information isn't on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.58,0:10:46.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,History is the only thing that this text contains.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.99,0:10:47.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.99,0:10:51.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pluton, I didn't\Nsee it anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.29,0:10:54.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It isn't mentioned on\Nthis Poneglyph at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.77,0:10:57.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not mentioned at all. I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.87,0:10:59.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.01,0:11:03.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've been an excellent\Npartner, but even so,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.21,0:11:05.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think that I'll kill\Nyou right here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.98,0:11:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.65,0:11:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The agreement that we made
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.89,0:11:11.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,four years ago has\Nbeen fulfilled.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.36,0:11:14.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the terms of that agreement?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.73,0:11:17.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was to bring you to the\NPoneglyph, and in turn,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.84,0:11:20.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you would hand over the\Ninformation on the weapon to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.99,0:11:22.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The work you've done for Baroque Works
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.79,0:11:25.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,these past four years\Nwas excellent
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.10,0:11:28.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,both in terms of intellect\Nand your ability to command.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.76,0:11:31.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your usefulness to the company\Nhas been reason enough
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.35,0:11:32.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to keep you around.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.00,0:11:35.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But in the end, you've spoiled it all...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.80,0:11:38.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...by betraying me, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.27,0:11:43.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You say the Poneglyph\Nin this country
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.31,0:11:46.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,doesn't say anything at all about Pluton.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.11,0:11:47.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.34,0:11:50.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Was this the plan all along,\Nto hide the information from me
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.71,0:11:53.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even if you were able to\Nfind something useful?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.91,0:12:01.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But even so, I don't\Nfeel any anger toward you,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.72,0:12:05.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and do you know why\Nthat is, Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.19,0:12:06.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.39,0:12:07.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've worked with you for four years.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.92,0:12:09.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd try something like this someday,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.69,0:12:11.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I'm more than ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:13.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.43,0:12:16.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you get wet, then a knife should go right into you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.37,0:12:19.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.70,0:12:29.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now all is forgiven, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.67,0:12:37.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because I never trusted you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.31,0:12:40.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From the very beginning\Nof our partnership,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.21,0:12:43.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew better than to do something as foolish as that.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can tell from Cobra's reaction
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.45,0:12:52.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that Pluton really does exist.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.23,0:12:55.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't need the Poneglyph.\NI can find the Pluton on my own.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.93,0:12:59.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once this country is mine, it's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.64,0:13:02.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.72,0:13:05.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's still too early for\Nthe attack on the Square.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.89,0:13:08.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It must be you. What did you do?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.71,0:13:10.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just a little present.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.95,0:13:12.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, this underground temple was built
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.85,0:13:14.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so that disturbing just one small column
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.95,0:13:17.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will destroy the balance\Nof the entire structure
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.22,0:13:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and cause it to collapse.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.97,0:13:21.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The two of you are going to die here.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.34,0:13:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll meet death together.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.01,0:13:26.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the 12th king of\Nthe Nefertari family.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.38,0:13:27.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will uphold our honor.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.01,0:13:29.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone like you could\Nnever be allowed
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.78,0:13:33.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to rule the desert kingdom.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.07,0:13:37.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Impressive. You truly\Nare a model king.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.81,0:13:40.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Willing to give your own life\Njust to take me down with you,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.01,0:13:43.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for your kingdom.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.15,0:13:45.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Except, I won't die.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.65,0:13:46.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.62,0:13:48.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is\Nchange the rocks to sand
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.84,0:13:50.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I can escape from here.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.72,0:13:54.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your death will be in vain, Cobra.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are only three minutes left.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.63,0:14:00.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When the square blows up and this temple collapses,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.20,0:14:04.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,everyone standing in my way will\Nbe eliminated in an instant.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.20,0:14:06.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And in that moment, this land...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.84,0:14:09.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...will become mine entirely.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.17,0:14:34.44,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Three minutes left. Where is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.47,0:14:36.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,A cannon big enough to\Ndestroy such a large area
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.87,0:14:38.44,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,has to be enormous.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.47,0:14:41.18,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,There can't be many places to hide such a weapon.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.21,0:14:45.41,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,So why are we still unable to find it after all this?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.45,0:14:48.02,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,An open space where\Na cannon would fit...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.05,0:14:51.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Stop shooting!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,353)}Open space!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.42,0:14:55.67,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0B0C08&\3c&H0B0C08&\4c&H0B0C08&\t(0,938,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}That's not fair, Koza.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.75,0:14:57.97,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0B0C08&\3c&H0B0C08&\4c&H0B0C08&\t(0,938,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}Hiding in a place like this the entire time?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.94,0:15:00.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,479)}Yeah, Leader, no fair!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.65,0:15:03.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! That place would work!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous! I told\Nyou to stop shooting at me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.82,0:15:06.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,0)}Taste Smoke Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.72,0:15:09.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's perfect. It's\Nhidden and it's big.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.96,0:15:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not\Nfrom the rebel army!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.63,0:15:13.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:15.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp Rubberband of Doom!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}That should teach ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.76,0:15:19.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do they know who they're\Ndealing with here?1
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.84,0:15:22.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid when I tell\Nyou this...no, be very afraid!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.11,0:15:25.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the incredible\NCaptain Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.85,0:15:26.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, it's you, Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.78,0:15:28.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, were you able to\Nfind the cannoneer?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.72,0:15:30.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know now. I've figured it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.55,0:15:32.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? You know where?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.90,0:15:34.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.13,0:15:35.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and signal everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.86,0:15:38.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're sure about this, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.70,0:15:43.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack:\NRed Serpent Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.27,0:16:21.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, I slept good!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.01,0:16:21.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.38,0:16:22.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.38,0:16:23.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I couldn't move all of a sudden
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.45,0:16:25.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I decided to risk it\Nand take a nap right here
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.99,0:16:28.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,since there was really\Nno other choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.92,0:16:32.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And I feel better now.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.86,0:16:33.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.52,0:16:37.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Time for me\Nto beat up Crocodile!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.74,0:16:49.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That hole over\Nthere looks kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:54.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...kinda croc-ish.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.34,0:16:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with this freaky\Nplace, anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.80,0:17:01.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The whole thing is crumbling into pieces!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.81,0:17:14.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it!\NThe cannon has to be in there.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.81,0:17:17.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't think of any other options besides that place.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.55,0:17:20.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What makes you so sure that\Nit's in there, anyway, Vivi?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.72,0:17:22.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to assume\Nthat this dust devil
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.16,0:17:24.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is part of the plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.09,0:17:25.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The cannon must be in a place
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.32,0:17:28.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,where they can still see well\Nenough to hit the target.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.20,0:17:34.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also, it has to be an open space\Nwhere a cannon can fit,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.17,0:17:36.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but where it can't be\Nseen from the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This place is\Nbig enough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.81,0:17:41.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,So then, let's make it\Nthe clan's secret base!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.74,0:17:42.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What do ya say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:43.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.01,0:17:45.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that has to be it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.58,0:17:46.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It makes perfect sense to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.92,0:17:48.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.24,0:17:50.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll leave the others a message\Nsince they're headed this way.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.41,0:17:53.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Usopp. I'm going\Nahead to the tower.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.11,0:17:55.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait, Vivi! Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.38,0:17:56.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:56.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.85,0:17:58.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.19,0:18:01.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the princess.\NWe found her, boys!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.33,0:18:05.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was just too easy.\NThe signal led us right to her.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.66,0:18:08.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are more members of\Nthe Baroque Works Billions.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.93,0:18:12.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! We signaled\Nthe enemy, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.93,0:18:15.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That smoke. It's Usopp's signal.\NHe must've found it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.67,0:18:18.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay. But why's the\Npalace so far away?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.11,0:18:21.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good. It's not far from here.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.81,0:18:24.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that signal means\Nthat they found the cannoneer.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.72,0:18:26.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They must have. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.99,0:18:32.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now! Noisy Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:40.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.53,0:18:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tremble at the\Npower of my nails!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.30,0:18:43.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, Vivi! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:44.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.80,0:18:46.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, over there! Get 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.88,0:19:10.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, it's you.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.82,0:19:14.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't get away. You're mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.96,0:19:16.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How are you still alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.96,0:19:19.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times I kill you,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.10,0:19:21.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you just keep coming\Nback for more.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.47,0:19:23.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well? Answer me, brat!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.90,0:19:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How'd he do it?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.44,0:19:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How did he live and come\Nhere? Who is this boy?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.08,0:19:38.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me, just how many times do you have to die?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.81,0:19:46.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's something you still\Nneed to return, Crocodile.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.41,0:19:48.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I came here to get it back.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.04,0:19:50.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this thing I took?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.95,0:19:54.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it money? Is it fame?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.81,0:19:58.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or people's trust? Their lives?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.55,0:20:00.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it rain?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.50,0:20:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have taken all\Nof those things.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.06,0:20:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So which is it that you want me to give back, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.82,0:20:11.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This land.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.82,0:20:12.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The land?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.72,0:20:15.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really, you should know better than that by now.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.19,0:20:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of relinquishing this country.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.10,0:20:20.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would I, when\NI'm going to become
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.29,0:20:23.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,its next king before long?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.20,0:20:25.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We came to this island to save Vivi's country.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But then, when we got here, it was gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.47,0:20:30.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You stole her country!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.57,0:20:36.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to get to the rebel army.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.96,0:20:38.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I must persuade their leader
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.66,0:20:41.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to stop all of this\Npointless bloodshed.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.99,0:20:43.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,688)}Up until a few short years ago,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.59,0:20:45.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,688)}it was a thriving city\Nfull of gardens,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.70,0:20:47.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,688)}and palm trees,\Nand lush greenery.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.27,0:20:51.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.50,0:20:56.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(1817,0,1,\c&HFEFDFE&\3c&HFEFDFE&\4c&HFEFDFE&)}You have to stop these fools from tearing our country apart!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.91,0:20:57.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is her country,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.79,0:21:00.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I'm here to take\Nit back from you.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.66,0:21:02.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,And what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.75,0:21:05.65,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What's so very wrong about\Nnot wanting to see people die?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.69,0:21:07.52,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Just being in this\Ncountry one day
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.59,0:21:12.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,and taking one a look\Naround, even I can tell...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.13,0:21:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...what this country\Nneeds more than anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.78,0:21:18.08,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You think that putting\Njust your life on the line
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.16,0:21:20.17,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,is enough to stop\Nthis from happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.20,0:21:21.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.66,0:21:24.16,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything else I can put on the line.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.46,0:21:28.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Just... Just me.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.83,0:21:32.16,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you can at least try\Nputting all of our lives
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.20,0:21:33.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,on the line together!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.91,0:21:36.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't we friends?! Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.82,0:21:45.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will defeat you and take this\Ncountry out of your evil hands.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.09,0:21:48.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then, Vivi will smile again!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.46,0:21:53.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Threaten me as much as you like,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.16,0:21:56.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but without any water, you're nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.27,0:22:07.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This is impossible.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.77,0:22:12.11,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any water,\Nso how can he kick me?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.18,0:22:16.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This is your fault, you monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.92,0:22:19.48,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This country would be peaceful if it weren't for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.82,0:22:23.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's heartbreaking, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.42,0:22:25.46,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Their love for the kingdom...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.49,0:22:28.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...will be what destroys it.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.46,0:22:38.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.78,0:22:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see. You're using...\Nyour blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.68,0:22:59.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Clever.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.52,0:23:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Blood can harden sand, too, can't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.67,0:23:16.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,First Rainbase,\Nand then the royal palace,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.36,0:23:19.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and now this underground temple.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.97,0:23:24.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should be rewarded for your\Ninsistence on challenging me.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.74,0:23:27.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even after I've put you through hell twice now,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.28,0:23:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you keep on coming back.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.08,0:23:30.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.37,0:23:36.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a pirate, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.44,0:23:38.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've certainly proven\Nthat in your determination
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.74,0:23:41.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to defeat me no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.25,0:23:42.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'll admit that\Nyou've become
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.59,0:23:44.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,an annoyingly\Npersistent opponent
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.30,0:23:46.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,during our three encounters.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.66,0:23:50.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right. What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.10,0:23:51.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A poisonous hook.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.94,0:23:52.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.94,0:23:55.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You seem to be a competent pirate, I suppose.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.01,0:23:57.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So surely, you must understand
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.94,0:24:00.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that a duel between\Npirates is always about
Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.48,0:24:02.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,two people fighting\Nfor survival.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.77,0:24:03.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And when that's the case,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.96,0:24:07.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's no such thing as playing dirty.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.56,0:24:15.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When the explosion happens in the Square,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.83,0:24:18.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this place will most likely crumble to dust.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.90,0:24:20.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This will be our final battle,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.90,0:24:24.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so let's settle this once and for all!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.38,0:24:29.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The smoke was coming\Nfrom this direction, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.39,0:24:33.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or was it? Argh.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.12,0:24:36.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha...? The Marines?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.46,0:24:38.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look. It's Roronoa Zoro.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.36,0:24:39.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.46,0:24:41.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize the Marines were in this town now.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.66,0:24:44.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.02,0:24:45.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.19,0:24:47.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice but to deal with them quickly.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.36,0:24:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you here in the middle of the battlefield?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.66,0:24:51.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what do you think you're doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.30,0:24:53.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I could say the\Nsame thing to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.67,0:24:54.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.86,0:24:55.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.77,0:24:57.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you head north at the next corner,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.27,0:24:59.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then you can reach the Palace Square.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.10,0:25:01.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go back and turn right!\NIt's not this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.27,0:25:02.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you that stupid?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.87,0:25:03.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.87,0:25:04.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.81,0:25:05.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.81,0:25:06.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. What the...? How di...?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.81,0:25:10.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Faster! We have to\Nrun faster, Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.38,0:25:11.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.65,0:25:15.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't let the princess get away!\NOur promotions are on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.72,0:25:19.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.17,0:25:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... Thank you?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.44,0:25:35.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're here to help you, not fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.41,0:25:37.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go stop the explosion\Nin the Square, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.81,0:25:38.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now go, quickly!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.68,0:25:41.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get going Usopp.\NCome on, hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.25,0:25:44.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(448.5,1053)}– Right!\N– Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.56,0:25:58.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry! We have to hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.83,0:26:00.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've wasted a lot of time!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.36,0:26:02.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know why they\Nhelped us back there,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.30,0:26:03.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but if it weren't\Nfor the Marines,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.36,0:26:05.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'd be a lot worse off now!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.84,0:26:17.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, don't look at that!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.82,0:26:18.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to help them!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.87,0:26:19.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't stop the explosion,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.87,0:26:22.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the casualties will be a lot worse than that!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.91,0:26:24.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.30,0:26:27.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crying about it isn't gonna\Nstop the attack from happening!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.42,0:26:33.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(517,0)}In two minutes,\Nwe're either gonna beat them,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.42,0:26:34.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or we're gonna die.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.52,0:26:36.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We still have time left!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.06,0:26:36.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.86,0:26:38.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we're all helping you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.39,0:26:39.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.28,0:26:47.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right there! Vivi! Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.55,0:26:50.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Nami! And Tony!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.15,0:26:51.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.08,0:26:53.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Marines just helped us out back there!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.05,0:26:55.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Were you able to find\Nwhere the cannon is?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.02,0:26:56.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We haven't confirmed it yet,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.02,0:26:58.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but that's this is the\Nonly place it can be!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.46,0:27:01.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We must've passed it a bunch\Nof times before I realized it.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.43,0:27:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The cannon is up there.\NI'm absolutely sure of it now.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.43,0:27:09.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The clock tower?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.55,0:27:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.78,0:27:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From up there, he can get a\Nreally good shot at the Square.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.18,0:27:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We still need Pell to get here, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.14,0:27:19.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.57,0:27:21.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pell.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.98,0:27:32.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.58,0:27:34.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I could've sworn I saw\Nthe smoke coming up
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.48,0:27:37.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from somewhere around this area.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.67,0:27:39.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit, ribbit.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.67,0:27:40.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.87,0:27:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just shot down that big bird\Nwith my Ribbit-Ribbit Gun.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.34,0:27:45.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.01,0:27:52.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.24,0:28:58.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.15,0:29:47.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He's so strong.\NWho in the world is he?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.75,0:29:51.15,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile made even our best\Nwarriors look like children.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.22,0:29:54.06,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,But now, he's\Nactually struggling.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.73,0:30:05.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were skewered,\Nburied alive, and dried up.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.75,0:30:08.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You may have made it through all that,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.25,0:30:11.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you won't escape this time, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.38,0:30:13.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no hope for survival.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.21,0:30:15.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The game is over.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:15.11,0:30:18.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This poison will spread through you soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.12,0:30:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, Crocodile?\NYou just don't understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.54,0:30:23.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.39,0:30:29.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pell? I don't see him\Nup there anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:29.89,0:30:30.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I don't think there's\Nany way that we can get
Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.82,0:30:33.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the top of the tower in less\Nthan a minute without any help.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.80,0:30:36.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pell, where are you?\NHurry. We need you.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.96,0:30:39.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For now, we're going to have\Nto get moving without him.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.77,0:30:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to climb\Nall these use the stairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.66,0:30:42.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.90,0:30:44.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.10,0:30:44.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.87,0:30:47.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Hey, Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.74,0:30:50.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what are you\Ndoing all the way up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:50.14,0:30:51.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.16,0:30:54.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You left a message where the smoke was, didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.83,0:30:56.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The message said\N"Go to the clock tower,"
Dialogue: 50,0:30:56.76,0:30:59.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I figured I'd better head up here to meet you.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:59.34,0:31:00.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what should I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.81,0:31:02.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's the cannoneer, anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.50,0:31:04.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The top! He's at the top!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.57,0:31:07.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go up from there and take him down!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:07.41,0:31:09.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.28,0:31:11.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where were you?\NI was looking!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:11.76,0:31:13.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro! You're here, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.76,0:31:15.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doin' down there?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:15.72,0:31:17.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Funny, I was gonna\Nask you the same thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.76,0:31:18.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was the Marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.70,0:31:20.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They kept saying\N"go north, go north,"
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.69,0:31:23.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I just kept going north till\NI got all the way up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:23.57,0:31:25.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"North" and "up"\Naren't the same thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.71,0:31:27.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, good job, you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.71,0:31:29.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now just keep on going up from there
Dialogue: 50,0:31:29.41,0:31:30.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and destroy the clock tower, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.91,0:31:32.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.66,0:31:34.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They can't get inside\Nthe clock tower
Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.50,0:31:35.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from where they are now.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.57,0:31:37.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, there are\Nonly two ways in:
Dialogue: 50,0:31:37.68,0:31:40.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The back stairs on the first\Nfloor and from the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:40.15,0:31:41.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why we need Pell!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:41.84,0:31:43.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But can't Zoro just go ahead
Dialogue: 50,0:31:43.01,0:31:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and destroy the wall\Nor something?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:44.74,0:31:45.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't risk that.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:45.64,0:31:46.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It could make the cannonball explode
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.97,0:31:48.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even earlier for all we know.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:48.74,0:31:51.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to take the stairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.08,0:31:53.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, wait. Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:53.62,0:31:55.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I have a better plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.56,0:32:02.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.80,0:32:12.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, Mr. 7,
Dialogue: 50,0:32:12.54,0:32:14.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,according to what\Nthe boss told us,
Dialogue: 50,0:32:14.44,0:32:17.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this is going to be our final\Nmission for Baroque Works.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:17.41,0:32:18.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,983)}Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit, ribbit.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:20.68,0:32:22.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's right, Miss Father's Day.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:24.52,0:32:27.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}According to the plan, we have\Njust 30 seconds left to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:28.17,0:32:29.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.56,0:32:35.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 7 and Miss Father's Day!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
